{"id":"2P","title":"Judgment and Punishment","part":{"n":2,"title":"Relationship to God"},"url":"/law/02-relationship-to-god/2p","entries":[{"id":"2P.1","text":"God judges, rewards and punishes every man according to his works and deeds.","refs":[{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":59,"verses":"18"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":21,"verses":"14"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":32,"verses":"19"},{"book":"Ezekiel","chapter":18,"verses":"30"},{"book":"Matthew","chapter":16,"verses":"27"},{"book":"Romans","chapter":2,"verses":"5-10"},{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":3,"verses":"13-15"},{"book":"2 Corinthians","chapter":5,"verses":"10"},{"book":"1 Peter","chapter":1,"verses":"17"},{"book":"Revelation","chapter":2,"verses":"23"},{"book":"Revelation","chapter":20,"verses":"13"},{"book":"Revelation","chapter":22,"verses":"12"}],"citation":"Isa. 59:18; Jer. 21:14; Jer. 32:19; Ezek. 18:30; Matt. 16:27; Rom. 2:5-10; 1 Cor. 3:13-15; 2 Cor. 5:10; 1 Pet. 1:17; Rev. 2:23; Rev. 20:13; Rev. 22:12."},{"id":"2P.2","text":"Punishment is the fruit and reward for iniquity and wicked ways (you shall reap that which you sow).","refs":[{"book":"Job","chapter":4,"verses":"8"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":91,"verses":"8"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":22,"verses":"8"},{"book":"Ecclesiastes","chapter":10,"verses":"8-9"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":3,"verses":"11"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":16,"verses":"18"},{"book":"Romans","chapter":6,"verses":"23"},{"book":"Galatians","chapter":6,"verses":"7-8"},{"book":"Hebrews","chapter":2,"verses":"2"}],"citation":"Job 4:8; Psa. 91:8; Prov. 22:8; Eccl. 10:8-9; Isa. 3:11; Jer. 16:18; Rom. 6:23; Gal. 6:7-8; Heb. 2:2."},{"id":"2P.3","text":"God punishes wickedness.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":26,"verses":"18"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":13,"verses":"11"}],"citation":"Lev. 26:18; Isa. 13:11."},{"id":"2P.4","text":"All who have sinned under the law will be judged by the law; but doers of the law shall be justified.","refs":[{"book":"Romans","chapter":2,"verses":"12-13"}],"citation":"Rom. 2:12-13."},{"id":"2P.5","text":"God chastises and punishes only His sons who He loves, for if you receive not chastisement, then are you bastards and not sons.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":89,"verses":"30-32"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":3,"verses":"11-12"},{"book":"Hebrews","chapter":12,"verses":"8"}],"citation":"Psa. 89:30-32; Prov. 3:11-12; Heb. 12:8."},{"id":"2P.6","text":"All must appear before the judgment seat of Christ, that each one may receive the things done in the body, according to what he has done, whether good or bad.","refs":[{"book":"2 Corinthians","chapter":5,"verses":"10"}],"citation":"2 Cor. 5:10."},{"id":"2P.7","text":"Be cautious if you walk in the ways of your heart, and in the sight of your eyes, for all these things God will bring you into judgment.","refs":[{"book":"Ecclesiastes","chapter":11,"verses":"9"}],"citation":"Eccl. 11:9."},{"id":"2P.8","text":"The LORD tests the righteous, but the wicked His soul hates; upon them He will rain coals, fire and brimstone and a burning wind.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":11,"verses":"5-6"}],"citation":"Psa. 11:5-6."},{"id":"2P.9","text":"Cursed be he that does not heed to all the words of the law.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":27,"verses":"26"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":11,"verses":"3-4"}],"citation":"Deut 27:26; Jer. 11:3-4."},{"id":"2P.10","text":"Mercy triumphs over judgment.","refs":[{"book":"James","chapter":2,"verses":"13"}],"citation":"James 2:13."},{"id":"2P.11","text":"Every one of us shall give account of himself to God.","refs":[{"book":"Romans","chapter":14,"verses":"12"}],"citation":"Rom. 14:12."},{"id":"2P.12","text":"Every idle word that men shall speak, they shall give account for it in the day of judgment. For by your words you shall be justified, and by your words you shall be condemned.","refs":[{"book":"Matthew","chapter":12,"verses":"36-37"}],"citation":"Matt. 12:36-37."},{"id":"2P.13","text":"Each one's work will become manifest and revealed by fire, and the fire will test each one's work, as to what sort it is.","refs":[{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":3,"verses":"13"}],"citation":"1 Cor. 3:13."},{"id":"2P.14","text":"Each one's faith will be tried with fire.","refs":[{"book":"1 Peter","chapter":1,"verses":"7"}],"citation":"1 Pet 1:7."},{"id":"2P.15","text":"God executes judgment here on the earth.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":10,"verses":"18"}],"citation":"Deut 10: 18."},{"id":"2P.16","text":"Rewards and punishments commence in this life.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":18,"verses":"20"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":11,"verses":"31"}],"citation":"Psa. 18:20; Prov. 11:31."},{"id":"2P.17","text":"Every man shall receive his own reward according to his own labor.","refs":[{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":3,"verses":"8"},{"book":"Colossians","chapter":3,"verses":"23-25"}],"citation":"1 Cor. 3:8; Col. 3:23-25."},{"id":"2P.18","text":"Punishment is given by disease and pestilence.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":15,"verses":"26"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":28,"verses":"21,35"},{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":26,"verses":"16-21"}],"citation":"Exod. 15:26; Deut 28:21, 2 Chron. 26:16-21."}]}